Agricrops
=========

Agricrops is a fork ("spiritual successor") of AgriCraft, a Minecraft mod
originally created by InfinityRaider and the AgriCraft contributors.

AgriCraft is licensed under the MIT License. Its original copyright notice and
license terms are retained verbatim in the LICENSE file at the root of this
repository, as required by that license:

    Copyright (c) 2014 InfinityRaider

Fork details
------------
  Upstream repository : https://github.com/AgriCraft/AgriCraft
  Upstream branch     : 1.12.2
  Fork point (commit) : d889388a "Added config option to disable agricraft commands"

This project also bundles, as git submodules, two further MIT-licensed libraries
by InfinityRaider / the AgriCraft org:

  lib/AgriCore     https://github.com/AgriCraft/AgriCore     (branch 1.12.2)
  lib/InfinityLib  https://github.com/InfinityRaider/InfinityLib
  lib/AgriPlants   https://github.com/AgriCraft/AgriPlants    (bundled plant JSON defaults)

Each retains its own upstream license; see the respective submodule directories.

Modifications
-------------
Code unchanged from upstream AgriCraft remains (c) its original authors under the
MIT License above. Changes made as part of the Agricrops divergence — beginning
with the rename of the mod id from `agricraft` to `agricrops`, and the migration
of the Java base package out of the upstream namespace
(`com.infinityraider.agricraft`) into the fork's own namespace
(`dev.omega24.agricrops`) — are (c) the Agricrops authors and are likewise
released under the MIT License. Bundled libraries (AgriCore, InfinityLib) keep
their original `com.infinityraider.*` namespace to mark the borrowed/new boundary.
